# artinspo — Tools & Services

## Current Stack (all free)

### Hosting & Deployment
- **Vercel** — Static site + serverless functions (free: 100GB bandwidth, 100K invocations/month)
  https://vercel.com

### AI Image Generation
- **Cloudflare Workers AI** — FLUX.1-schnell model (free: ~2,000 images/day, no credit card)
  https://cloudflare.com

### Email Delivery
- **Resend** — Transactional email API (free: 100 emails/day, 3,000/month)
  https://resend.com

### Fonts
- **Google Fonts** — Inter + Playfair Display (free, unlimited)
  https://fonts.google.com

### Source Control
- **GitHub** — Code hosting + version control (free)
  https://github.com

## Keys / Env Vars Needed

### Vercel (On-Demand API)
- `RESEND_API_KEY` — from https://resend.com (add in Vercel dashboard)
- `CF_API_TOKEN` — from https://cloudflare.com (Account → API Tokens)
- `CF_ACCOUNT_ID` — from Cloudflare dashboard sidebar
- `FROM_EMAIL` — custom from address (e.g. `artinspo<hello@artinspo.co.uk>`)

### GitHub Actions (Daily Email)
- `RESEND_API_KEY` — from https://resend.com (add in GitHub Secrets)
- `FROM_EMAIL` — custom from address (add in GitHub Secrets)

## Repository
- https://github.com/MH-787b/INSPO.git

## Daily Email System (Active as of Mar 31, 2026)
- Runs at **9 AM UTC daily** via GitHub Actions
- Reads subscribers from `data/subscribers.json`
- Generates unique image + prompt for each subscriber
- Sends via Resend API (supports up to 100 emails/day free tier)

